{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06299","headline":"澄水如监 · 崔颢","name":"澄水如监","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣贤将立喻，上善贮情深。\n洁白依全德，澄清有片心。\n浇浮知不挠，滥浊固难侵。\n方寸悬高监，生涯讵陆沈。\n对泉能自诫，如镜静相临。\n廉慎传家政，流芳合古今。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}